cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CAMBactive: CAMB extension for active sources in the CMB"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Raidal"
    given-names: "Juhan"
    affiliation: "University of Nottingham"
  - family-names: "Moss"
    given-names: "Adam"
    affiliation: "University of Nottingham"

repository-code: "https://github.com/JRaidal/CAMBactive"
url: "https://github.com/JRaidal/CAMBactive"

abstract: >
  CAMBactive is an extension of the CAMB cosmology code to compute cosmic microwave
  background power spectra from active sources such as cosmic string networks.
  It builds on CAMB and includes implementations for cosmic string source models.

keywords:
  - cosmology
  - CMB
  - cosmic microwave background
  - cosmic strings
  - Boltzmann code
  - CAMB

license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"

version: "master"

date-released: 2026-02-16